The Button tab can also search icon packs through Iconify's public API
(https://iconify.design). It offers only packs whose licenses allow use without credit
on each icon, and records each picked icon's pack and license with the look:

Material Symbols (Apache-2.0), Material Design Icons (Apache-2.0), Fluent UI System
Icons (MIT), Phosphor (MIT), Tabler Icons (MIT), MingCute (Apache-2.0), Carbon
(Apache-2.0), Bootstrap Icons (MIT), Lucide (ISC), Iconoir (MIT), Ionicons (MIT),
Heroicons (MIT), Meteocons (MIT), Weather Icons (OFL-1.1).

Apart from the collections above, no icon from these packs ships with the driver;
an icon is fetched only when an installer picks it.
